@startuml teacher_create_test
title Teacher Create Test

actor Teacher
boundary "CreateTestPage" as UI
control "TestController" as Controller
control "TestService" as Service
control "QuestionBuilderFactory" as Factory
control "QuestionBuilder" as Builder
entity "TestRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

Teacher -> UI: Tạo bài thi
UI -> Controller: POST /api/tests

Controller -> Controller: Validate dữ liệu

alt Dữ liệu không hợp lệ
Controller --> UI: 422 Validation Error
UI --> Teacher: Hiển thị lỗi
else Hợp lệ


Controller -> Service: createTest()

Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

Service -> Repo: createTest()
Repo -> DB: INSERT test
DB --> Repo: Test
Repo --> Service: Test

loop Mỗi câu hỏi

    Service -> Factory: make(questionType)
    Factory --> Service: Builder

    Service -> Builder: build(questionData)
    Builder --> Service: Question Data

    Service -> Repo: createQuestion()
    Repo -> DB: INSERT question
    DB --> Repo: Question ID

    Service -> Repo: attachQuestion()
    Repo -> DB: INSERT test_questions

end

Service -> Repo: attachClasses()
Repo -> DB: INSERT class_tests

Service -> DB: COMMIT

Service --> Controller: Test Created

Controller --> UI: 201 Created

UI --> Teacher: Thông báo thành công


end

note right of Service
Builder Pattern:

* Factory tạo Builder phù hợp
* Builder xây dựng dữ liệu câu hỏi
* Hỗ trợ nhiều loại câu hỏi:

  * MCQ
  * Fill Blank
  * Matching
  * Table Fill
    end note

@enduml
